        <h2 id="armor-progression">Armor Progression</h2>
        <div class="guide-grid">
          <div class="guide-card">
            <span class="card-label">Profile</span>
            <h3>Normal Profiles</h3>
            <p>Purchase a <strong>Sundial (TOP PRIORITY)</strong> on the <strong>Auction House</strong></p>
            <p>As it lets you to throw away Rancher’s Boots(Nobody on normal profile uses this anyways), using the 4/4 Farming sets instead of 3/4, you get more profits</p>
            <p>After the Sundial, start up with the Farming Sets (Use 3/4 if you don’t have Sundial yet but craft the full set)</p>
            
          </div>

          <div class="guide-card">
            <span class="card-label">Profile</span>
            <h3>Ironman</h3>
            <p>Good Luck on doing Greenhouses, which will be explained later.</p>
            <p>Stick to Rancher’s Boots before even getting this.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="guide-card">
            <span class="card-label">Comparison</span>
            <h3>For Both Profiles</h3>
            <p>The progress armor will be:</p>
            <h3>Farmhand Armor → Haymaker → Sprout → Tater → Cropie → Squash → Fermento → Helianthus</h3>
            <h3>Note that every sucessor armor requires the predecessor tier of armor to craft.</h3>

            <p>Farmhand Armor requires <strong>Farming 3</strong> to be used, in order to craft it, you need <strong>Wheat Collection 2</strong> to craft.
              It requires <strong>196 Wheat</strong> to craft. (40 for Helmet, 64 for Chestplate, 56 for Leggings, 36 for Boots)</p>
            <br>

            <p>Haymaker Armor requires <strong>Farming X(10)</strong> to be used, in order to craft it, you need <strong>Wheat Collection 6</strong>to craft.
              It requires <strong>32 Enchanted Wheat</strong> to craft. (8 each for each pieces)</p>
            <br>

            <p>Sprout Armor requires <strong>Farming (Yet to know)</strong> to be used, in order to craft it, you need <strong>Carrot Collection 7</strong> to craft.
              It requires <strong>256 Enchanted Carrots</strong> to craft. (64 each for each piece)</p>
            <br>

            <p>Tater Armor requires <strong>Farming 20</strong> to be used, in order to craft it. It requires <strong>1024 Enchanted Potato</strong> to craft (256 each for each piece)</p>
            <br>

            <p>After obtaining Tater Set, you can farm <strong>Wheat, Carrot, Potato</strong> any 1 of them with a 0.05% chance of to drop a Cropie, and the Cropie Talisman. 
              You’ll need <strong>80 Cropies, 40 Enchanted Hay Bale, 18 Box of Seeds, 45 Enchanted Baked Potato, 30 Enchanted Golden Carrot</strong> for the whole 4/4 set, 
              256 Cropies for the Cropie Talisman.</p>
            <br>

            <p>After getting the Cropie set, farming Pumpkin, Melon, and Cocoa Beans have a 0.03% chance of dropping Squash while wearing 4/4 of the set. 
              It requires <strong>80 Squashes, 36 Polished Pumpkins, 144 Enchanted Melon Blocks, 50 Enchanted Cookie</strong> to craft from Cropie.</p>
            <br>

            <p>Squash, farming Sugar Cane, Cactus, Mushroom and Nether Warts will drop Fermento, with a 0.007% chance of dropping when wearing 4/4 of the set. 
              It requires 8 Condensed Fermento(1 Condensed is crafted by using 9 Fermentos), 96 Enchanted Sugar Cane, 64 of each Enchanted Mushroom Block, 70 Mutated Nether Warts and 25 Enchanted Cactus to craft.</p> 
            <br>

            <p>You are now on the Last Tier of the armor, Helianthus, by farming Sunflowers (Set your Garden time to Day), Moonflowers (Set your Garden time to Night), Wild Roses, with a 0.004% chance of dropping a Helianthus. 
              It also requires 8 Condensed Helianthus (1 Condensed is crafted by using 9 Helianthus), 3 Stacks of Compacted Wild Rose, 4 Stacks of Compacted Sunflower and Moonflower to craft.</p>
            <br>
          </div>
        </div>

